Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":377,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":71025,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1619363,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":242965,"Name":"Jass7","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242965.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1336881069,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":43,"Preview":{"Id":1619363,"PostDate":1336881069,"PostContent":"I need some help with picking wedding colors. My favorite color is blue, so for long time I was...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jasbride@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311975768,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242965.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jass7","Id":242965,"Name":"Jass7","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"089f7a2cb2098f7145606767a7dc1dc0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I need some help with picking wedding colors. My favorite color is blue, so for long time I was drawn to navy blue and watermelon pink, but now I&#039;m not sure&amp;nbsp;if I&amp;nbsp;can pull that off with a beach wedding. I see my fiance wearing grey suit, and was thinking maybe blue\/orange or orange\/pink would look better for beach. It&#039;s hard to picture it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; How did you pick your colors? Any advice?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1619363,"PostDate":1336881069,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I need some help with picking wedding colors. My favorite color is blue, so for long time I was drawn to navy blue and watermelon pink, but now I'm not sure\u00a0if I\u00a0can pull that off with a beach wedding. I see my fiance wearing grey suit, and was thinking maybe blue\/orange or orange\/pink would look better for beach. It's hard to picture it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How did you pick your colors? Any advice?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jasbride@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311975768,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242965.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jass7","Id":242965,"Name":"Jass7","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"323ec92bb3d79d8e0d36f689c13477e0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve got to admit that I love the idea of a navy and watermellon\/fuschia, probably because it&#039;s not the typical color scheme for&amp;nbsp;a destination wedding.&amp;nbsp; I love bold color schemes and I think they make for a great complimentary contrast to a beach backdrop.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My colors are chartreuse and sangria.&amp;nbsp; My colors were inspired by a green cymbidium orchid, which is my favorite flower. I love them, feminine bright, and my Fi approved and actually likes them.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My suggestion is to play around with creating inspiration color boards to to see what combinations really speak to you and your Fi. There are also plenty to look at on google.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1619377,"PostDate":1336885307,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I've got to admit that I love the idea of a navy and watermellon\/fuschia, probably because it's not the typical color scheme for\u00a0a destination wedding.\u00a0 I love bold color schemes and I think they make for a great complimentary contrast to a beach backdrop.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My colors are chartreuse and sangria.\u00a0 My colors were inspired by a green cymbidium orchid, which is my favorite flower. I love them, feminine bright, and my Fi approved and actually likes them.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My suggestion is to play around with creating inspiration color boards to to see what combinations really speak to you and your Fi. There are also plenty to look at on google.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tapurnell@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1326177751,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249670.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChocoTaco7568","Id":249670,"Name":"ChocoTaco7568","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cef4cf695998b583c45108e99fcac41c","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ChocoTaco7568[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I&#039;ve got to admit that I love the idea of a navy and watermellon\/fuschia, probably because it&#039;s not the typical color scheme for a destination wedding.  I love bold color schemes and I think they make for a great complimentary contrast to a beach backdrop.  \n \n My colors are chartreuse and sangria.  My colors were inspired by a green cymbidium orchid, which is my favorite flower. I love them, feminine bright, and my Fi approved and actually likes them. \n \n My suggestion is to play around with creating inspiration color boards to to see what combinations really speak to you and your Fi. There are also plenty to look at on google.[\/quote] \n Thanks! I like your colors. \n \n We are leaning towards pink and orange, and possible blue. I&#039;m trying to come up with inspiration boards right now so that should help. If anyone on here has done pink and orange and blue I would love to see it! \n \n I&#039;m mainly going to use these colors of chair sashes, table runner, flowers, and paper lanterns.","Attachments":[],"Id":1620778,"PostDate":1337189093,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ChocoTaco7568<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I've got to admit that I love the idea of a navy and watermellon\/fuschia, probably because it's not the typical color scheme for\u00a0a destination wedding.\u00a0 I love bold color schemes and I think they make for a great complimentary contrast to a beach backdrop.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My colors are chartreuse and sangria.\u00a0 My colors were inspired by a green cymbidium orchid, which is my favorite flower. I love them, feminine bright, and my Fi approved and actually likes them.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My suggestion is to play around with creating inspiration color boards to to see what combinations really speak to you and your Fi. There are also plenty to look at on google.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Thanks! I like your colors.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are leaning towards pink and orange, and possible blue. I'm trying to come up with inspiration boards right now so that should help. If anyone on here has done pink and orange and blue I would love to see it!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm mainly going to use these colors of chair sashes, table runner, flowers, and paper lanterns.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jasbride@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311975768,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242965.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jass7","Id":242965,"Name":"Jass7","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5862da58dfd18c5df4e7fb724db5e9b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m also doing a beach wedding and am doing the decorations in yellow\/orange and the bridesmaids\/groommen&#039;s ties in a coral pink color!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1620982,"PostDate":1337224207,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm also doing a beach wedding and am doing the decorations in yellow\/orange and the bridesmaids\/groommen's ties in a coral pink color!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristina.miller1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1334385457,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253985.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kmiller8609","Id":253985,"Name":"kmiller8609","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"10ae89121876cc15e3f494e161c74337","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I had wanted to do bright colors, such as orange and pink, but my fiance said no way, to girly.&amp;nbsp; We came to a comprimise and ended up with turqoise and lime green.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1621029,"PostDate":1337229366,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I had wanted to do bright colors, such as orange and pink, but my fiance said no way, to girly.\u00a0 We came to a comprimise and ended up with turqoise and lime green.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jkergen@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"137.186.71.240","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1293163500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234788.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JayKay","Id":234788,"Name":"JayKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"52e67549bffbe2de62887b86f5d97f2f","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Jass7[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I need some help with picking wedding colors. My favorite color is blue, so for long time I was drawn to navy blue and watermelon pink, but now I&#039;m not sure if I can pull that off with a beach wedding. I see my fiance wearing grey suit, and was thinking maybe blue\/orange or orange\/pink would look better for beach. It&#039;s hard to picture it. \n \n How did you pick your colors? Any advice?[\/quote] \n \n I like the blu but it&#039;s difficult find bluflowers so I decided for pink and fuxia that are much more easy to mix with arreangments, flowers, gifts, etc...","Attachments":[],"Id":1636909,"PostDate":1341165502,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Jass7<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I need some help with picking wedding colors. My favorite color is blue, so for long time I was drawn to navy blue and watermelon pink, but now I'm not sure\u00a0if I\u00a0can pull that off with a beach wedding. I see my fiance wearing grey suit, and was thinking maybe blue\/orange or orange\/pink would look better for beach. It's hard to picture it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How did you pick your colors? Any advice?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> I like the blu but it's difficult find bluflowers so I decided for pink and fuxia that are much more easy to mix with arreangments, flowers, gifts, etc...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sgp147k1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"2.234.176.173","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1325113055,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249008.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":191,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CriCri","Id":249008,"Name":"CriCri","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74f2db77c93d654fc8de50a8d499e965","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]CriCri[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n I like the blu but it&#039;s difficult find bluflowers so I decided for pink and fuxia that are much more easy to mix with arreangments, flowers, gifts, etc...[\/quote] \n Navy would be so cool, don&#039;t let it go just cuz you cant&#039;t picture it.  go nave on sashes on chairs and things and then pink in flowers and a few accents it would be so pretty.  but blue and orange rock! \n \n I am dong blue and coral (spicy pink:) \n \n leaving in 2 days and I am still back and forth on what blue exactly its either sky or turquoise","Attachments":[],"Id":1637098,"PostDate":1341208652,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>CriCri<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> I like the blu but it's difficult find bluflowers so I decided for pink and fuxia that are much more easy to mix with arreangments, flowers, gifts, etc...<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Navy would be so cool, don't let it go just cuz you cant't picture it. \u00a0go nave on sashes on chairs and things and then pink in flowers and a few accents it would be so pretty. \u00a0but blue and orange rock!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am dong blue and coral (spicy pink:)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> leaving in 2 days and I am still back and forth on what blue exactly its either sky or turquoise\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"niccc80@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1309036074,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241562.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nicc80","Id":241562,"Name":"nicc80","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc919f44048f45574b9105f012646b35","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I think the blue and pink would be gorgeous. You could do the navy as an accent and have it as the type color on your place cards\/ thnak you&#039;s etc, navy straws, as others have mentioned use it as sash colors, the ribbon on the bottom or your bouquets, etc. Then use pink in other places.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My main wedding colors are yellow and grey, with pool blue (FI&#039;s favorite color) as an accent.\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1637878,"PostDate":1341374660,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I think the blue and pink would be gorgeous. You could do the navy as an accent and have it as the type color on your place cards\/ thnak you's etc, navy straws, as others have mentioned use it as sash colors, the ribbon on the bottom or your bouquets, etc. Then use pink in other places.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My main wedding colors are yellow and grey, with pool blue (FI's favorite color) as an accent.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"creativespicebyshan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1336189745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254958.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shanandcal","Id":254958,"Name":"shanandcal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d93bbe310b3a78527f4e76099258cffa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Its really problematic while you are thinking about the wedding dresses &amp;amp; color. But what I think is that you always have to wear what you think will be the most suitable for you. In your wedding you will wear such dresses which will give you the princess look. Dress will always not only the matter, you should have to think about the decoration, color, party, foods, banquet halls and all. You can get full planning from here also: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.matrixconferenceandbanquetcenter.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.matrixconferenceandbanquetcenter.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1638224,"PostDate":1341473804,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Its really problematic while you are thinking about the wedding dresses & color. But what I think is that you always have to wear what you think will be the most suitable for you. In your wedding you will wear such dresses which will give you the princess look. Dress will always not only the matter, you should have to think about the decoration, color, party, foods, banquet halls and all. You can get full planning from here also: <a href='http:\/\/www.matrixconferenceandbanquetcenter.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.matrixcon...quetcenter.com\/<\/a><br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"matrixconferencebanquetcenter@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1341473015,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"matrix","Id":257485,"Name":"matrix","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ddacc86bd4a152519ad960a64b4bac8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I ended up getting pink sashes, and really like pink and orange together. So those are the colors we are using mostly. I do wish I could sneak in blue somehow. However I have not gotten anything orange so I can still change my mind.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span alt=\":D\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1341495174060_820\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1638264,"PostDate":1341497878,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I ended up getting pink sashes, and really like pink and orange together. So those are the colors we are using mostly. I do wish I could sneak in blue somehow. However I have not gotten anything orange so I can still change my mind.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<span alt=\":D\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1341495174060_820\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jasbride@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311975768,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242965.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jass7","Id":242965,"Name":"Jass7","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"67485","Title":"Wedding colors","LastPostDate":1447226584},"Pages":{"TotalItems":377,"TotalPages":38,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":370},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
