l-looks-of-wedding-party-table-decoration-ideas-with-pretty-d.jpg\" alt=\"interior-round-table-with-purple-tablecl\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherineriverace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425104317,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RitvikSehgal","Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":7140,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b46e18b8a395d1c285ce14b2ba22cd1a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi girls..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For table runners, we have many ideas and suggestions... for instance, you can match the runners with your wedding colors. This is an \u00edtem where you can print your personality and add your touch :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81814]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81125]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79015]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:44040]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Adventure Weddings&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Puerto Vallarta&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Toll: 1.866.731.81.52&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902365,"PostDate":1439405630,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi girls..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For table runners, we have many ideas and suggestions... for instance, you can match the runners with your wedding colors. This is an \u00edtem where you can print your personality and add your touch <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81814-table-setup-idea\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_10944\/sml_gallery_258213_10944_479229.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Table Setup Idea'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Table Setup Idea' id='sml_image_view_81814' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81125-table-set-up-and-flowers\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_10944\/sml_gallery_258213_10944_165714.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Table Set up and Flowers'  width='200' height='168'  alt='Table Set up and Flowers' id='sml_image_view_81125' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79015-ready\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_726279.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='ready'  width='200' height='134'  alt='ready' id='sml_image_view_79015' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Adventure Weddings<\/p>\n<p>Puerto Vallarta<\/p>\n<p>Toll: 1.866.731.81.52<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343062403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
